Scope

The MIT licence above covers the code in this repository: the analysis and
extraction tools, the 8086->C lifter, the recompilation runtime and HAL, the
build files, and the documentation.

It does NOT and cannot cover Sid Meier's Civilization itself. The original
executable, its overlays and its data files are not distributed here, and you
need a legitimate copy of the game to use any of this. The lifted C is a
derivative work of that binary; it is generated from your own copy and is not
tracked in this repository.

Civilization is a trademark of Take-Two Interactive Software, Inc. / Firaxis
Games. This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to
Take-Two Interactive, Firaxis Games, or the estate of MicroProse Software.
